    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "The purpose of this report is to determine the relationship between viscosity ratio and dispersion coefficient in unconsolidated sand. A summary of the work done on miscible displacement is presented. A detailed description of the experimental equipment is included. From preliminary experiments, absorbance differences between vacuum oil and kaydol at 400 nm will be used as a method of analysis.",
